r 13:8; Ac 27:18,19,38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-24","title":"Luke 12:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>the ravens.The raven is a species of the corvus, or crow tribe, of the order Picae, known by its large size, its plumage being of a bluish black, and tail roundish at the end. It was probably selected by our Lord as being unclean.</p>\n<p>1Ki 17:1-6; Job 38:41; Ps 145:15,16; 147:9; Mr 6:26 how. 7,30-32; Job 35:11; Mt 10:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-25","title":"Luke 12:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>19:3; Mt 5:36; 6:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-26","title":"Luke 12:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>why. 29; Ps 39:6; Ec 7:13; 1Pe 5:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-27","title":"Luke 12:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>the lilies. 24; Mt 6:28-30; Jas 1:10,11 that. 1Ki 10:1-13; 2Ch 9:1-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-28","title":"Luke 12:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>which. Isa 40:6; 1Pe 1:24 O ye. 8:25; Mt 8:26; 14:31; 16:8; 17:17,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-29","title":"Luke 12:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>seek. 22; 10:7,8; 22:35; Mt 6:31 neither, etc. or, live not in careful suspense.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-30","title":"Luke 12:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>all. Mt 5:47; 6:32; Eph 4:17; 1Th 4:5; 1Pe 4:2-4 your. 32; Mt 6:1,8,32; 10:20; 18:14; Joh 20:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-31","title":"Luke 12:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>10:42; 1Ki 3:11-13; Ps 34:9; 37:3,19,25; 84:11; Isa 33:16; Mt 6:33 Joh 6:27; Ro 8:31; 1Ti 4:8; Heb 13:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-32","title":"Luke 12:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>little. So 1:7,8; Isa 40:11; 41:14; *marg: Isa 53:6; Mt 7:15; 18:12-14; 20:16; Joh 10:26-30 it is. 10:21; Mt 11:25-27; Eph 1:5-9; Php 2:13; 2Th 1:11 the kingdom. Jer 3:19; Mt 25:34; Joh 18:36; Ro 6:23; 8:28-32; 2Th 1:5; Heb 12:28 Jas 2:5; 1Pe 1:3-5; 2Pe 1:11; Re 1:6; 22:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-33","title":"Luke 12:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>Sell. 18:22; Mt 19:21; Ac 2:45; 4:34,35; 2Co 8:2 provide. 16:9; Hag 1:6; Mt 6:19-21; Joh 12:6; 1Ti 6:17-19; Jas 5:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-34","title":"Luke 12:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>where. Mt 6:21; Php 3:20; Col 3:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-35","title":"Luke 12:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>your loins. 1Ki 18:46; Pr 31:17; Isa 5:27; 11:5; Eph 6:14; 1Pe 1:13 your lights. Mt 5:16; 25:1,4-10; Php 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-36","title":"Luke 12:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>men. 2:25-30; Ge 49:18; Isa 64:4; La 3:25,26; Mt 24:42-44; Mr 13:34-37 Jas 5:7,8; 2Pe 1:13-15; Jude 1:20,21 return. Mt 22:1-14; 25:1-13 when. So 5:5,6; Re 3:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-37","title":"Luke 12:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>Blessed. 43; 21:36; Mt 24:45-47; 25:20-23; Php 1:21,23; 2Ti 4:7,8; 1Pe 5:1-4 2Pe 1:11; 3:14; Re 14:13 that. Isa 62:5; Jer 32:41; Zep 3:17; Joh 12:26; 13:4,5; 1Co 2:9; Re 3:21 Re 7:17; 14:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-38","title":"Luke 12:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>Mt 25:6; 1Th 5:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-39","title":"Luke 12:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>Mt 24:43,44; 1Th 5:2,3; 2Pe 3:10; Re 3:3; 16:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-40","title":"Luke 12:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>21:34-36; Mt 24:42,44; 25:13; Mr 13:33-36; Ro 13:11,14; 1Th 5:6 2Pe 3:12-14; Re 19:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-41","title":"Luke 12:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>Lord. Mr 13:37; 14:37; 1Pe 4:7; 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-42","title":"Luke 12:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>Who. 19:15-19; Mt 24:45,46; 25:20-23; 1Co 4:1,2; Tit 1:7 steward. 16:1-12; Mt 20:8; 1Pe 4:10 ruler. 1Ti 3:15; 5:17; Heb 3:5; 13:7,17 to give. Jer 23:4; Eze 34:3; Mt 13:52; Joh 21:15-17; Ac 20:28; 1Pe 5:1-4 in due. Pr 15:23; Isa 50:4; 2Ti 4:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-43","title":"Luke 12:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>whom. 37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-44","title":"Luke 12:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","c