ference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":58,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":58},"content":"<p>thou goest. Pr 25:8,9; Mt 5:23-26 give. 14:31,32; Ge 32:3-28; 1Sa 25:18-35; Job 22:21; 23:7; Ps 32:6 Pr 6:1-5; Isa 55:6; 2Co 6:2; Heb 3:7-13 the judge. 13:24-28; Job 36:17,18; Ps 50:22 into. Mt 18:30; 1Pe 3:19; Re 20:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-12-59","title":"Luke 12:59","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":59,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":59},"content":"<p>thou shalt. 16:26; Mt 18:34; 25:41,46; 2Th 1:3 mite. Mr 12:42; *marg:</p>"}]}